      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean the breathing thing is probably just anxiety if it happens, i get chest tightness when i'm stressed. i'll just stick to the ibuprofen and the ice for now. if i take a higher dose of the ibuprofen like 800mg every few hours it'll knock the swelling down faster right? i really dont want to go to the ER if i can just handle this at home.",
